  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "OSI Wells Shock Kits are an evolution of the traditional well soap sticks. The kits are designed to tackle any conceivable problem downhole.",
   "box": {
    "x": 678,
    "y": 207,
    "w": 518,
    "h": 48
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "The advantage of using OSI Wells Shock is that this is a perfect compatibility with the chemical compounds in our chem screens. This elimanates any possibility of a surprising chemical reaction downhole.",
   "box": {
    "x": 678,
    "y": 279,
    "w": 518,
    "h": 72
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "There are six types of chemical treatments that we provide: scale, paraffin, corrosion, asphaltene, defoamer, and acid surfactant.",
